### Eliminates:

* MCP call bloat
* tool chaining loops
* redundant memory queries
* distributed decision logic

### Enables:

* single-shot retrieval
* deterministic execution graphs
* predictable connector behavior
* scalable system expansion without complexity increase

---

# 15. FINAL SYSTEM STATEMENT

> MCP is no longer a mediator of tools. It is a compiler of intent into executable structure.

